     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">היי חקי,</div><div dir=\"rtl\">1) תבדוק מהו:</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><div dir=\"rtl\"><div dir=\"rtl\">Sys.getlocale()</div><div>ואם זה לא עברית, תריץ:</div><div><div>Sys.setlocale(&quot;LC_ALL&quot;, &quot;Hebrew&quot;)</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>ותראה אם זה פותר את זה.</div><div><br></div><div>2) אפשר גם לנסות את זה:</div><div><div> options(encoding =&quot;UTF-8&quot;)</div><div> options(&quot;encoding&quot;)</div><div>אבל אני לא בטוח שזה יעזור.</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>תספר אם משהו מהם עבד :)</div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>\r\n\r\n\r\nContact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497029174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1le6fAlokkKQNdy0P0NcGP\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497029174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KDUKJ3frx9dxClGD5YwpT\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497029174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3fxQoQAImxFIavN-OEDzjX\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br></div></div>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2013/4/8 haki <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">haki