     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">הרצתי את הקוד שלך אצלי.</div><div dir=\"rtl\">הדוגמה הבאה לא החזירה הודעות שגיאה כלל:</div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px\">temp.file&lt;- tempfile()</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px\">\r\ndownload.file(<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;line-height:18px\">&quot;<a href=\"http://humus101.com/?p=2737\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://humus101.com/?p%3D2737&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497029177000&amp;usg=AOvVaw313t_wso4r-Vul0_Yzm0aP\">http://humus101.com/?p=2737</a>&quot;</span>, destfile = temp.file)</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px\">doc&lt;-xmlRoot(htmlParse(temp.file))<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px\" dir=\"rtl\">בפרט, שים לב לשימוש ב- htmlParse</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px\" dir=\"rtl\">האם זה פותר את הבעייה?</div><div><br></div></div><div><br>\r\n</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2013/4/8 haki <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hakib...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
